0..68 Comment "/// This source compares one lambda with a composite of two lambdas."
69..72 Comment "///"
73..138 Comment "/// The two lambda bodies return the same path for each argument."
139..194 Comment "/// A bind over the inner composite reads its endpoint."
195..198 Comment "///"
199..269 Comment "/// The kernel evaluates the composite calls inside the action motive."
270..324 Comment "/// The two codes then compare by the same path rules."
325..328 Comment "///"
329..373 Comment "/// - see: #3824 — returning variable call"
374..411 Comment "/// - see: #4011 — lambda composite"
